WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.699
I remember this story

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.820
of an evil witch,

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:25.240
And the princess she cursed to sleep forever.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.400
The story became legend.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:34.060
But this is no fairy tale.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:38.620
There are many who prey on the innocent,

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.320
I'm sure your kind would agree.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:45.260
If I didn't know better, I'd say we're making a threat.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:46.800
Well, do you?

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:47.700
Do I what?

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:48.880
Know better?

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.280
What have you done?

